## The deep lantern

@narrator: At the middle of the sea one lantern burns under the water, not on it.
@hollow{emotion="neutral"}: That one is mine. The first wish I ever gave up on.
@narrator{when="count(rowedWith(_)) >= 1"}: The one at the bow leans over the side and looks down with you.
@nyx{when="holds(vigilWish(vesper))"}: Vesper's candle is down there too. The one you lit at the vigil. She pretends she doesn't know.
@lumi{when="holds(learned(frostKing))"}: The Frost King's lantern. The codex said he'd drowned it himself.
<match on="quest.frostMissions.state">
  <when is="complete">
    @nyx{emotion="happy" when="count(vigilWish(_)) == 0"}: You lit your vigil candle for him. Look, it's still going.
    @nyx{when="count(vigilWish(_)) >= 1"}: You kept the whole vigil. Every candle out there is a little bit yours.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @lumi: Somebody should light a candle for him. Maybe at the next vigil.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@lumi{emotion="happy"}: Chapter 4, cleared. The sea's a little brighter. Not all the way. Enough.
